       todo task --done TASK [TEXT]
       todo task --undone TASK
       todo task --wait TASK REASON
       todo task --resume TASK TEXT
       todo task --due TASK DATE
       todo task --priority TASK P
       todo task --move TASK CATEGORY

Show a task, or perform one task operation.
"""


